# SILVORA: HTTP security headers (Netlify and Cloudflare Pages both read this file).
#
# Content-Security-Policy limits what the browser may load or contact, the main defence
# against injected scripts stealing a signed-in customer's session. Allowed:
#   - our own files, Google Fonts,
#   - *.supabase.co (authentication and database; add your custom domain here if you use one),
#   - api.gold-api.com (live silver rate when no server-side endpoint is deployed).
# If you add a new third-party service, add its origin to the matching directive.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://*.supabase.co https://api.gold-api.com; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
